        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Leviticus 13:8",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "When the plague of leprosy is in a man, then he shall be brought unto the priest;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Leviticus 13:9",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And the priest shall see him: and, behold, if the rising be white in the skin, and it have turned the hair white, and there be quick raw flesh in the rising;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 29
          },
          {
            "start": 43,
