          },
          {
            "start": 166,
            "end": 168
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Leviticus 13:13",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "But when raw flesh appeareth in him, he shall be unclean.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Leviticus 13:14",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "And the priest shall see the raw flesh, and pronounce him to be unclean: for the raw flesh is unclean: it is a leprosy.",
