        "reference": "Leviticus 13:17",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "The flesh also, in which, even in the skin thereof, was a boil, and is healed,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
