        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "And in the place of the boil there be a white rising, or a bright spot, white, and somewhat reddish, and it be shewed to the priest;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
