        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "But if the priest look on it, and, behold, there be no white hairs therein, and if it be not lower than the skin, but be somewhat dark; then the priest shall shut him up seven days:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
