        "reference": "Leviticus 13:21",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "And if it spread much abroad in the skin, then the priest shall pronounce him unclean: it is a plague.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 90,
            "end": 92
          }
