        "reference": "Leviticus 13:26",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 26
      },
      {
        "text": "And the priest shall look upon him the seventh day: and if it be spread much abroad in the skin, then the priest shall pronounce him unclean: it is the plague of leprosy.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 52,
