        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 27
      },
      {
        "text": "And if the bright spot stay in his place, and spread not in the skin, but it be somewhat dark; it is a rising of the burning, and the priest shall pronounce him clean: for it is an inflammation of the burning.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 101,
