        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 32
      },
      {
        "text": "He shall be shaven, but the scall shall he not shave; and the priest shall shut up him that hath the scall seven days more:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 83,
            "end": 96
