        "reference": "Leviticus 13:47",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 47
      },
      {
        "text": "Whether it be in the warp, or woof; of linen, or of woollen; whether in a skin, or in any thing made of skin;",
