        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 48
      },
      {
        "text": "And if the plague be greenish or reddish in the garment, or in the skin, either in the warp, or in the woof, or in any thing of skin; it is a plague of leprosy, and shall be shewed unto the priest:",
        "footNotes": [
