        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 49
      },
      {
        "text": "And the priest shall look upon the plague, and shut up it that hath the plague seven days:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 55,
            "end": 67
