        "verseNumber": 52,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Leviticus 13:52",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 52
      },
      {
        "text": "And if the priest shall look, and, behold, the plague be not spread in the garment, either in the warp, or in the woof, or in any thing of skin;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 53,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Leviticus 13:53",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 53
      },
      {
        "text": "Then the priest shall command that they wash the thing wherein the plague is, and he shall shut it up seven days more:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 91,
            "end": 95,
            "text": "HEB quarantine it seven days the second time."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
