        "reference": "Leviticus 13:55",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 55
      },
      {
        "text": "And if the priest look, and, behold, the plague be somewhat dark after the washing of it; then he shall rend it out of the garment, or out of the skin, or out of the warp, or out of the woof:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 48,
            "end": 50
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 56,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Leviticus 13:56",
        "book": "Leviticus",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 56
      },
      {
        "text": "And if it appear still in the garment, either in the warp, or in the woof, or in any thing of skin; it is a spreading plague: thou shalt burn that wherein the plague is with fire.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 103,
